        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Kero Kero Cowboy</i></strong> is a brand new western themed platformer developed for the Game Boy Color! You play as Kero Kero, a frog on a journey to wrangle the wild west's most dangerous outlaws &amp; bring peace to the untamed land. Face dastardly foes, perilous platforming challenges, and intense shootouts across deserts, mines, mountains, trains, forests, and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884910/extras/a6faceb26b3776bbcde60677064d5bb1.poster.avif?t=1767071313\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884910/extras/a6faceb26b3776bbcde60677064d5bb1.webm?t=1767071313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884910/extras/a6faceb26b3776bbcde60677064d5bb1.mp4?t=1767071313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kero Kero features an array of techniques and abilities to help him on his quest. He can eat enemies, spit them back out, or even brandish a giant revolver to dispatch far-off foes! But be aware, a 6-shooter only has room for 6 bullets, so use them wisely! He can also swim with ease, ride in a giant cowboy boot to stomp enemies, ride rails in a mine cart, and spit hot fire after eating a spicy jalapeño pepper. How to best utilize his abilities in each scenario is up to you, the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884910/extras/e01ae03bc849f0876a10aafb728e2ec4.poster.avif?t=1767071313\" width=800 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884910/extras/e01ae03bc849f0876a10aafb728e2ec4.webm?t=1767071313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884910/extras/e01ae03bc849f0876a10aafb728e2ec4.mp4?t=1767071313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels of rootin' tootin' retro platforming action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 intense &amp; challenging boss fights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special collectibles that unlock extra-challenging bonus levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game music player to jam out to the Kero Kero Cowboy original soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic retro handheld gaming experience! This game runs on a <i>real</i> Game boy Color!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kero Kero Cowboy was originally designed to be played on the Game Boy Color, but the Steam version supports full Controller &amp; Keyboard support! Controls are as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character &amp; Cursor Movement</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong>  Directional Pad or Left Joystick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Arrow Keys or WASD Keys</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump &amp; Menu Selections</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> Right Face Button (&quot;O&quot; on Playstation, &quot;B&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Z&quot; or &quot;J&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attack</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> Bottom face button (&quot;X&quot; on Playstation, &quot;A&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Control&quot; or &quot;K&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> &quot;Options&quot; button on Playstation, &quot;Start&quot; button on Xbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Enter&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip/Unequip Weapon</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> Top face Button (&quot;△&quot; on Playstation, &quot;Y&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Shift&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlay Menu* (for quick reset or volume control)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> &quot;Share&quot; on Playstation, &quot;Back&quot; on Xbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Esc&quot; key<br><i>*Please note that options in the Overlay Menu can only be selected by using a mouse</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
