 ><strong>Attack</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> Bottom face button (&quot;X&quot; on Playstation, &quot;A&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Control&quot; or &quot;K&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> &quot;Options&quot; button on Playstation, &quot;Start&quot; button on Xbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Enter&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip/Unequip Weapon</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> Top face Button (&quot;△&quot; on Playstation, &quot;Y&quot; on Xbox)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Shift&quot; key</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overlay Menu* (for quick reset or volume control)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller:</strong> &quot;Share&quot; on Playstation, &quot;Back&quot; on Xbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong> &quot;Esc&quot; key<br><i>*Please note that options in the Overlay Menu can only be selected by using a mouse</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
